		color: var(--color-coin);
		border: 2rpx solid var(--color-coin);
		border-radius: 4rpx;
		padding: 2rpx 10rpx;
		margin-left: 12rpx;
	}

	.converted-hint {
		font-size: 21rpx;
		color: var(--color-muted);
		margin-top: 12rpx;
	}
</style>

